# Testing Conventions

## Framework

Vitest with globals enabled. Tests in `src/__tests__/`.

## Patterns

- `describe('moduleName')` → `describe('functionName')` → `it('returns X when Y')`
- Test pure logic first, mock I/O
- Mock `@actions/core` for input/output testing
- Mock `@actions/github` for API testing — never call real APIs
- Mock `fetch` for LLM and webhook testing

## Coverage

- Every exported function must have tests
- Test success paths, error paths, and edge cases
- Optional features (LLM, webhooks, codenames) must test graceful failure

## Running

```bash
npm test              # Single run
npm run test:watch    # Watch mode
npm run test:coverage # Coverage report
```
